   Council Software Engn; SIGPLAN},
Abstract = {This research abstract presents two approaches for utilizing the
   developers' subjective design quality evaluations during the software
   lifecycle. In process-based approach developers study and improve their
   system's structure at fixed intervals. Tool-based approach uses
   subjective evaluations as input to tool analysis. These approaches or
   their combination are expected to improve software design and promote
   organizational learning about software design.},
